OL,4,CEx-rugby player says sex assault       
OL,5,C'never happened'                       
OL,6,GA former England rugby league player   
OL,7,Gand TV pundit accused of putting her   
OL,8,Ghand up a woman's skirt in a cricket   
OL,9,Gclub toilet has told a jury it         
OL,10,G"categorically did not happen".        
OL,12,FDanika Priim, 42, has been charged     
OL,13,Fwith carrying out the alleged sexual   
OL,14,Fassault in the toilets at Horsforth    
OL,15,FCricket Club in Leeds on 22 July 2022. 
OL,17,FHer accuser, who cannot be named for   
OL,18,Flegal reasons, previously told a trial 
OL,19,Fat Leeds Crown Court how Priim twice   
OL,20,Freached up her dress and grabbed her   
OL,21,Funderwear.                             
